              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’at anyun Belsasar ng’atutiet, ak kolaakyi bik Daniel ngoriet ne arus ne birir, ak kolaakyi kaatinnyi sirimdab tahabu, ak komwaita agobo inendet kole, egu bounindet ne bo somok eng’ bounatet.",
          "type": "text",
